WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:06,410
Nothing to do

2
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:12,660
You can also eat delicious hot dishes and rice.

3
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:16,300
The braised pork is more fragrant, okay? There’s a lot of meat.

4
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,910
But the two of them helped eat and treated it the same way

5
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:21,750
Why should she eat meat and we drink soup?

6
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:23,610
she is my person

7
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,290
You are day laborers

8
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:26,690
The captain hasn't woken up yet

9
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:31,000
When you're full, work hard, sister.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,760
Let's get the captain out and we can't watch it ourselves.

11
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,160
Don't let me meet you even once

12
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,520
She's in my hole

13
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,970
Let the hostages out

14
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,410
Pat your butts

15
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,740
What should we do if Xu Pingyang is also kidnapped?
